to time out.\n  - *Resolution*: `op-release` automatically rolled back live to Slot A. Verified live rollback without reboot.\n- **Error 5: UI Chat error `\"Apply an available catalog model with a confirmed native routing binding...\"` (Unresolved)**:\n  - *Trigger*: User selected `qwen3.5-35b-a3b` and sent a message.\n  - *Root Cause*: `selectRoute()` either failed or was not invoked/confirmed before `submit()` was called, leaving `confirmedRoute` null. Also, the latest UI build from `/srv/git/3tched.com/dist` has not been published to op-web.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Active Context\n- **Services Currently Up & Verified**:\n  - `op-grpc-bridge` (pid 9111) on `10.0.0.2:8090`\n  - `op-web` (pid 12053) on `10.0.0.2:8080`\n  - `tched-router` (pid 6750) on `127.0.0.1:8084`\n  - `unified-execution` (pid 9066)\n  - `emqx` (pid 9965)\n  - `omp-auth-broker` (pid 27751) on `127.0.0.1:8765`\n  - `omp-gateway` (pid 2429) on `0.0.0.0:4000`\n- **Active Release Slot**: Slot A (`release-9b52e195-0253-4616-8a98-2b2f16d9defb`).\n- **Repositories**:\n  - Main workspace: `/srv/git/odbus-verified` (Git branch `restore/devuan-storage-20261013`)\n  - UI repo: `/srv/git/3tched.com` (Git branch `claude/ui-gallery-promotion`, built to `dist/`)\n\n---\n\n### 6. Next Steps\n1. **Inspect `ModelPicker.svelte` and `App.svelte` in `/srv/git/3tched.com`**:\n   - Check where the model change event triggers `selectRoute()` and why selecting `qwen3.5-35b-a3b` did not set `appliedRoute`.\n   - Inspect what `catalog.models` contains and whether `qwen3.5-35b-a3b` is marked `available: true`.\n2. **Publish the Built UI to op-web**:\n   - Check whether `op-web` is currently serving the stale static build from `/usr/local/share/op-dbus/dashboard-release`.\n   - Run the publication command from `/srv/git/3tched.com`:\n     ```bash\n     cd /srv/git/3tched.com && URL_PREFIX=/ VITE_OPDBUS_DOOR=https://10.0.0.2:8090 npm run publish:op-web\n     ```\n   - If `/usr/local/share/op-dbus/dashboard-release` is read-only, ensure `OP_WEB_DASHBOARD_OVERLAY` or publication mechanism updates the served files.\n3. **Verify Subscribed Rendering**:\n   - Inspect `followKnowledge` in `/srv/git/3tched.com/src/chat/knowledge-feed.ts` and `FeedBoundCanvas.svelte` / `ApplicationRenderer.svelte`.\n   - Ensure the gRPC-Web subscription to `:8090` for canvas and feed updates connects and is not being blocked by CORS, SSL, or credential mismatches.\n4. **End-to-End Test**:\n   - Verify selecting `qwen3.5-35b-a3b` (or other catalog model) confirms the native route and that submitting a message renders the response and subscribed canvas without error.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- **Preserve System Integrity**: No foreign service managers (`sv` only, no `systemctl`). Do not reboot the host.\n- **Frontend Stack**: Strictly Svelte/SvelteKit + Vite + `@json-render/svelte`.\n- **Identity & Capability Enforcement**: All operations must route through declared D-Bus/gRPC-Web `:8090` interfaces preserving OIA1/SID1 tokens.\n</summary>\n\n# Conversation Logs\nStart with the compact transcript; if a step has `truncated_fields`, read only that specific line in `transcript_full.jsonl`:\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl`\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript_full.jsonl`"}
